{
  "_comment": [
    "Cara 2: hook http langsung, tanpa install skrip apa pun.",
    "",
    "Claude Code nge-POST payload hook-nya langsung ke endpoint ERPNext. Nggak",
    "ada Node, nggak ada file yang perlu disalin ke tiap mesin.",
    "",
    "KEKURANGANNYA, dan ini bukan hal kecil: hook http TIDAK bisa async. Tiap",
    "tool call nunggu respons ERPNext dulu. Lewat Cloudflare itu biasanya",
    "200-400 ms, dan itu kena ke SETIAP Read, Edit, dan Bash. Pakai ini kalau",
    "nggak bisa naruh skrip di mesinnya; kalau bisa, pakai settings.command.json.",
    "",
    "allowedEnvVars itu wajib — tanpa itu, $XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN diganti string",
    "kosong dan semua request ketolak 401 tanpa pesan apa-apa.",
    "",
    "Nama agent dikirim lewat header X-Office-Agent, BUKAN query string. Query",
    "string hilang kalau request bawa body JSON (Frappe mengganti form_dict",
    "dengan isi body), dan hook selalu bawa body — dulu pakai ?agent= dan",
    "namanya diabaikan diam-diam. Hapus header itu kalau mau server nebak dari",
    "nama folder kerja (jadi 'cc/nama-project')."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "https://erp.x-sha.id/api/method/xsha_office.api.hook",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "token $XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN",
              "X-Office-Agent": "claude-code"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "https://erp.x-sha.id/api/method/xsha_office.api.hook",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "token $XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN",
              "X-Office-Agent": "claude-code"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "https://erp.x-sha.id/api/method/xsha_office.api.hook",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "token $XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN",
              "X-Office-Agent": "claude-code"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PermissionDenied": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "https://erp.x-sha.id/api/method/xsha_office.api.hook",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "token $XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN",
              "X-Office-Agent": "claude-code"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "https://erp.x-sha.id/api/method/xsha_office.api.hook",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "token $XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN",
              "X-Office-Agent": "claude-code"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": ["XSHA_OFFICE_TOKEN"]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
